もしれないだろ。それで頭がくらくらしたら、飛べなくなっちゃうぞ。","nextNodeIds":[746680119]},{"nodeId":746680119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2784455690,"text":"モンドでおまえに会う前みたいに…","nextNodeIds":[746680120]},{"nodeId":746680120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":276643378,"text":"じゃあ、また釣り上げてあげるよ！","nextNodeIds":[746680121]},{"nodeId":746680121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1648194322,"text":"…ほ、ほんとか？だったら、一緒に水に入ってもいいぞ。いいか、絶対に約束は守ってくれよ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":746680116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":129135818,"text":"パイモンだってできる！","nextNodeIds":[746680117]},{"nodeId":746680110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4021895186,"text":"わあっ！今ならエラ呼吸ができそう！","nextNodeIds":[746680111]},{"nodeId":746680111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3547489938,"text":"だったら、まずはエラがないとだな。ったく、元気そうだし、心配して損したぞ。","nextNodeIds":[746680112]},{"nodeId":746680105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":959455762,"text":"水が吹き出たとか？","nextNodeIds":[746680106]},{"nodeId":746680106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2027074930,"text":"おお、さすがは水神の国だな。七天神像まで水を吹き出すのか…って、そんなわけないだろ！あの光は、どう考えても普通じゃなかったぞ。","nextNodeIds":[746680107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7466801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7466801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_IS_DIVEABLE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7466801","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":